@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName sans-serif
skinparam roundCorner 10

title EduCore — Assignment Lifecycle & Submission Flow

actor "Lecturer" as Lecturer
actor "Student" as Student
participant "EduCore Web App" as App
database "PostgreSQL DB" as DB
storage "MinIO Storage" as MinIO

== Assignment Publishing ==
Lecturer -> App : Create Assignment (Title, Due Date, Max Points)
App -> DB : Insert assignments row
App -> Student : Send new assignment notification

== Student Submission ==
Student -> App : Open /my-assignments & select task
Student -> App : Upload solution file (PDF/ZIP)
App -> App : Check deadline (set is_late if past due)
App -> MinIO : Store submission file in S3
App -> DB : Insert assignment_submissions record
App --> Student : Confirm submission receipt

== Grading & Feedback ==
Lecturer -> App : Download student submissions
Lecturer -> App : Enter numeric score & qualitative feedback
App -> DB : Update assignment_submissions (score, feedback, graded_at)
App -> Student : Notify student of grade availability

@enduml
